        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/marrakesh/_scene_spider.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 1e142575-830c-4e58-8bdb-8d39b613e406).Image",
        "Description": "&quot;Marakkesh is proving to be increasingly dangerous for our client. More and more bounty hunters approach every day. We need to bring him somewhere abroad, to safety. We have reached a deal with a local smuggler in order to bring Mr. Yuzhong safely abroad, but he wants us to do a job for him first. A certain Link Parr, one of his biggest rivals. An easy job.\rI wish you good luck.&quot;\rThe client calls on the other line. Some  bounty hunters have found his safehouse. Two more targets to deal with.",
